WEBVTT

1
00:01:11.044 --> 00:01:13.135
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Sorry I’m late.

2
00:01:14.622 --> 00:01:16.945
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> No problem.

3
00:01:19.361 --> 00:01:20.755
Are you OK?

4
00:01:21.615 --> 00:01:23.009
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah, I’m fine.

5
00:01:24.437 --> 00:01:25.773
Congratulations, Ben.

6
00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:28.387
Your show was great.

7
00:01:30.547 --> 00:01:31.999
I’m sorry I left like that.

8
00:01:34.137 --> 00:01:34.973
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> That’s OK.

9
00:01:36.936 --> 00:01:39.201
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No, it’s not OK.

10
00:01:40.317 --> 00:01:41.943
I don’t know why I did that.

11
00:01:44.812 --> 00:01:45.718
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Don’t worry.

12
00:01:47.042 --> 00:01:48.181
I understand.

13
00:01:48.936 --> 00:01:53.780
Andre isn’t easy sometimes.

14
00:01:56.231 --> 00:01:59.262
Is that why you left the school?

15
00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:04.675
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I didn’t really like him as a teacher, but no.

16
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.941
Andre wasn’t the problem.

17
00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.368
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> What was the problem?

18
00:02:11.285 --> 00:02:18.557
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I love taking photos, but…when I was at the school, I stopped loving it.

19
00:02:20.311 --> 00:02:23.854
I thought it was what I wanted to do, but it wasn’t.

20
00:02:26.316 --> 00:02:27.640
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> That’s too bad.

21
00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:33.681
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah…but it was a good decision.

22
00:02:34.715 --> 00:02:36.527
I love photography again.

23
00:02:37.897 --> 00:02:40.767
And now I’m in the ‘real world.’

24
00:02:42.718 --> 00:02:46.993
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> And how is it? The real world?

25
00:02:49.119 --> 00:02:49.978
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I like it.

26
00:02:51.755 --> 00:02:53.602
I think I like it.

27
00:02:56.286 --> 00:02:58.923
Let’s go. Where’s the restaurant?

28
00:02:59.225 --> 00:03:00.677
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s this way.

29
00:03:05.776 --> 00:03:08.773
Can I see some of your photos now, please?

30
00:03:09.005 --> 00:03:12.084
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Oh, I don’t take many photos these days.

31
00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.615
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yes, you do. You take photos all the time.

32
00:03:15.615 --> 00:03:16.475
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do I?

33
00:03:16.893 --> 00:03:18.984
Do I take photos all the time?

34
00:03:19.042 --> 00:03:22.550
Mm? Mm? Smile, please…